Title: Judge's X Word Puzzle No. 27
Author: Andrew Bruno
Date: 1927-10-29
Byline: Submitted by Andrew Bruno, Chicago, Ill. Judge pays $10 for each puzzle printed.
Date-Note: printed; archive.org metadata says 1927-10-22
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-10-22_93/page/n31/mode/1up
Number: 27
Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-10-29_93/page/n24/mode/1up


ALONE#FAT#DOMES
MONEY#ATE#ELECT
US#TEAR#LEAD#LA
SEE#SIMILAR#HAT
ERAS#REFIT#FATE
##STEER#NEVER##
ATTENDS#GRAMMAR
NO#AT#####LA#PA
TORMENT#ABILITY
##AERIE#LADEN##
